    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Twin Martial Souls",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Lin Fan, born into the noble family of Dalin Prefecture, was once a peerless genius who received the Heaven's Pride Token. However, he was betrayed by his fiancée, who stole his martial soul, leaving him crippled.\r\n\r\nWhen a mysterious demon parasitically bonds with Lin Fan, it reactivates his discarded martial soul and grants him a rare dual martial soul constitution. From that moment, Lin Fan embarks on a path of ascension—from a small county town to traversing the myriad worlds of the heavens.",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "The Rise of Twin Souls",
        "Shuāng Shēng Wǔ Hún."
    ],
